<section class="chapter" aria-labelledby="role-title"><h2 id="role-title">Across the product</h2><div class="chapter-copy">
<p class="lead">I lead design across myColorado, working across product, brand, and digital identity.</p>
<p>My work spans the end-to-end experience, with deeper focus on individual features and teams when needed. That includes a design system I built from scratch for iOS and Android, and helping our team unblock a long-running mobile driver’s license initiative and <a class="cm-inline-link" href="https://x.com/GovofCO/status/2094562971292762554" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="cm-intro-link-text">bring it to </span><span class="cm-intro-link-end"><span class="cm-intro-link-text">launch</span><svg class="cm-intro-link-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12 12 4M4 4h8v8"/></svg></span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>.</p>
<p>Beyond the app, my work spans web experiences, including myColorado.gov, alongside broader product strategy and exploration.</p>
<dl class="facts"><div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Design lead</dd></div><div><dt>Platforms</dt><dd>iOS / Android / Web</dd></div><div><dt>Scope</dt><dd>Product / Brand / Digital identity</dd></div></dl>
</div></section>
